# Suburban-SOC — local (non-vendor-derived) Suricata signatures.
#
# Standard Suricata idiom for site-authored rules, kept separate from the
# categorized starter set #446 (M23 Stage 3) lands alongside it. Empty for
# now (Stage 1, #443/#444 — sensor deployment + eve.json ingest only; Stage
# 2, #445 — CI syntax gate/SID registry/pcap-replay promotion gate; no rule
# content yet). Local SIDs, if any land here later, use the
# 9500001-9599999 range reserved for this file (distinct from the
# 9000001-9000100 range #446's starter set owns) — see
# tests/detections/suricata_rules_eval.py's SID_RANGES, which enforces
# this in CI: any SID outside a registered range fails the build.
